recovery passes multiply the cost by 1.1x and add 314 candidate pairs 
for +0 YES and +2 MAYBE. 
 
If this ratio is near 1, the bundle is the problem, not the passes, and 
the 44x sits in whatever REF-active.rds is missing. If it is large, the 
recovery passes are the lever and D1-acronym is the first suspect. 
